{
  "name": "Linkedin Content System Framework",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "**An AI Agent that generates a week's worth of content in minutes, with full editorial control, that posts automatically on social media - turning hours of work into 15 minutes of review.**\n\n- Google Sheets setup: Create content calendar with: topic, date, status, generated_post, edited_post, approved checkbox.\n- Agent/Workflow 1 - Generator (8am): Pull brand voice → Get today's topics → AI generates posts → Create images → Save for review\n- Manual review step: Edit posts in sheet between workflows, check \"approved\" when ready\n- Agent/Workflow 2 - Publisher (9am): Get approved posts → Post to LinkedIn → Update status to \"posted\"\n- Key connections: Google Sheets to store,  Upload-Post for LinkedIn\n- Testing: Run with one test post through entire flow - generate, review, edit, approve, publish",
        "height": 256,
        "width": 1216
      },
